WEBVTT

00:00:30.085 --> 00:00:32.274
Now, the essence of this proverb is:

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:35.704
even though a woman gives physical birth
to each particular child,

00:00:35.728 --> 00:00:37.748
the whole community
plays an important role

00:00:37.772 --> 00:00:39.442
in looking after all children.

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:42.626
Growing up, it was not uncommon
for me to come home

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:44.175
and see my mom preparing a meal

00:00:44.199 --> 00:00:46.210
for what felt like
the entire neighborhood.

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:48.802
She routinely shared food
with people struggling.

00:00:48.826 --> 00:00:51.365
And I recall one day
being angry as a teenager.

00:00:51.389 --> 00:00:52.625
It was a hot day.

00:00:52.649 --> 00:00:54.320
I'd just completed doing errands.

00:00:54.344 --> 00:00:56.654
I was looking forward
to a nice home-cooked meal.

00:00:56.678 --> 00:00:58.978
But when I came home,
there was little food left,

00:00:59.002 --> 00:01:01.399
because it had gone
to the neighborhood kids again.